## WinGet

| Taak | Commando |
|------|-----------|
| Software zoeken | `winget search naam` |
| Software installeren | `winget install -e --id Publisher.App` |
| Installeren zonder vragen | `winget install -e --id Publisher.App --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements` |
| Geïnstalleerde software tonen | `winget list` |
| Updates tonen | `winget upgrade` |
| Alles updaten | `winget upgrade --all` |
| Software verwijderen | `winget uninstall naam` |
| Sources tonen | `winget source list` |
| Sources resetten | `winget source reset --force` |

bron:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/package-manager/winget/download

